    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Classify taxonomically disputed forms among highly mobile sexual animals and compare their frequency in sympatric versus geographically separated pairs, controlling study effort. A substantially lower within-country frequency supports the claim.";
